00:30:31.846 --> 00:30:35.166
some fundamental issues there with the proposed bill.

521
00:30:35.206 --> 00:30:38.686
The centralization of decision making will be critical.

522
00:30:39.246 --> 00:30:41.946
Our hapū, our iwi, at place,

523
00:30:42.906 --> 00:30:43.886
the ability to

524
00:30:44.766 --> 00:30:48.146
be sure that we'll have the appropriate level of engagement

